| resultReference | WorkflowArtifactReference | 1 |
| completionFacts | WorkflowArtifactReference | * |
| executionEvidence | WorkflowExecutionEvidence | ? |

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

RepositorySyncNativeMergeReviewSubmissionResult

#### submitRepositoryConflictDecision

##### DESCRIPTION

Consume the pending Human choice, actual resolution texts, rationale and genuine result/evidence reference. The host independently attests question/answer. ProvideResolution/Defer/Cancel retain their bounded meaning and grant no file/command/remote authority. Return committed acceptance/message; explicit Advance selects authorized continuation, while unavailable handling remains an error.

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

RepositorySyncHumanConflictAnswer

